#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:6
msgid "## Migration Plan Supplement (2026-06-02)"
msgstr "## 迁移方案补充（2026-06-02）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:9
msgid ""
"> **Archived / historical record** — RFC #1 migration completed 2026-06-05; "
"steps 0–11 below for reference, not current operational guide.  > Responds "
"to Issue discussion #4 (migration strategy), with current-state assessment "
"conclusions."
msgstr ""
"> **归档 / 历史记录** — RFC #1 迁移已于 2026-06-05 完成；下文步骤 0–11 供查"
"阅，非当前操作指南。 > 回应 Issue 待讨论 #4（迁移策略），并补充现状评估结论。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:11
msgid ""
"### Strategy: Parallel New Packages + Bottom-Up Per-Package Migration "
"(Strangler Fig)"
msgstr "### 策略选型：并行新包 + 自底向上逐包迁移（Strangler Fig）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:13
msgid ""
"No incremental refactor inside old directories; **flatten directories by RFC "
"layer at repo root**, migrate **package by package starting from kernel**. "
"**Migration completed 2026-06-05** (`packages/`, `apps/` removed)."
msgstr ""
"不在旧目录内渐进重构，而是在仓库根目录**按 RFC 层级平铺目录**，从 **kernel 起"
"逐包向上迁移**。**迁移已于 2026-06-05 完成**（`packages/`、`apps/` 已删除）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Confirmed decisions:**\n"
msgstr "**已确认决策：**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:18
msgid ""
"**Directory layout:** Flat at root — `kernel/`, `engine/`, `life/`, "
"`capabilities/`, `connectors/`, `service/`, `cli/`"
msgstr ""
"**目录布局**：根目录平铺 — `kernel/`、`engine/`、`life/`、`capabilities/`、"
"`connectors/`、`service/`、`cli/`"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:18
msgid ""
"**Package naming:** `@freeanima/{layer}-{slug}` (see [`AGENTS.md`](../../"
"AGENTS.md))"
msgstr ""
"**包命名**：`@freeanima/{layer}-{slug}`（见 [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md)）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:20
msgid "### New Stack Package Naming (2026-06-04)"
msgstr "### 新栈包命名（2026-06-04）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:22
msgid ""
"Single source of truth for naming: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md#新栈包命名"
"rfc-1)."
msgstr "命名单一真相源：[`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md#新栈包命名rfc-1)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Form | Pattern | Examples |\n"
"| ---- | ------- | -------- |\n"
"| Layer aggregate | `@freeanima/{layer}` | `kernel`, `engine`, `service` |\n"
"| In-layer component | `@freeanima/{layer}-{slug}` | `kernel-eventbus`, `engine-tool`, `life-memory` |\n"
"| In-layer implementation | `@freeanima/{layer}-{slug}-{impl}` | `connectors-eventbus-sqlite`, `capabilities-provider-openai` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 形态     | 模式                               | 示例                                                         |\n"
"| -------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| 层聚合   | `@freeanima/{layer}`               | `kernel`、`engine`、`service`                                |\n"
"| 层内组件 | `@freeanima/{layer}-{slug}`        | `kernel-eventbus`、`engine-tool`、`life-memory`              |\n"
"| 层内实现 | `@freeanima/{layer}-{slug}-{impl}` | `connectors-eventbus-sqlite`、`capabilities-provider-openai` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:30
msgid ""
"Slug compound words without internal hyphen (`eventbus` not `event-bus`)."
msgstr "slug 合成词不加内连字符（`eventbus` 非 `event-bus`）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:32
msgid "### Target Directory Structure"
msgstr "### 目标目录结构"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:61
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"freeanima/\n"
"├── kernel/\n"
"│   ├── eventbus/              # @freeanima/kernel-eventbus\n"
"│   ├── hooks/                 # @freeanima/kernel-hooks\n"
"│   ├── logging/               # @freeanima/kernel-logging\n"
"│   └── kernel/                # @freeanima/kernel (aggregate)\n"
"├── engine/                    # @freeanima/engine (aggregate); subpackages engine-tool, engine-provider, etc.\n"
"├── life/\n"
"│   ├── memory/                # @freeanima/life-memory\n"
"│   ├── self/                  # @freeanima/life-self\n"
"│   └── estate/                # @freeanima/life-estate\n"
"├── capabilities/\n"
"│   ├── tools/                 # @freeanima/capabilities-tools\n"
"│   ├── provider/              # @freeanima/capabilities-provider (or capabilities-provider-openai)\n"
"│   ├── mcp/                   # @freeanima/capabilities-mcp\n"
"│   ├── acp/                   # @freeanima/capabilities-acp\n"
"│   └── clarify/               # @freeanima/capabilities-clarify\n"
"├── connectors/\n"
"│   ├── eventbus-sqlite/       # @freeanima/connectors-eventbus-sqlite\n"
"│   ├── gateway/               # @freeanima/connectors-gateway\n"
"│   ├── webui/                 # @freeanima/connectors-webui (HTTP server + Vue SPA)\n"
"│   ├── cron/                  # @freeanima/connectors-cron\n"
"│   └── commands/              # @freeanima/connectors-commands\n"
"├── service/                   # @freeanima/service (AnimaService + serve)\n"
"├── cli/                       # @freeanima/cli\n"
"└── tests/                     # @freeanima/integration-tests\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"freeanima/\n"
"├── kernel/\n"
"│   ├── eventbus/              # @freeanima/kernel-eventbus\n"
"│   ├── hooks/                 # @freeanima/kernel-hooks\n"
"│   ├── logging/               # @freeanima/kernel-logging\n"
"│   └── kernel/                # @freeanima/kernel（聚合）\n"
"├── engine/                    # @freeanima/engine（聚合）；子包 engine-tool、engine-provider 等\n"
"├── life/\n"
"│   ├── memory/                # @freeanima/life-memory\n"
"│   ├── self/                  # @freeanima/life-self\n"
"│   └── estate/                # @freeanima/life-estate\n"
"├── capabilities/\n"
"│   ├── tools/                 # @freeanima/capabilities-tools\n"
"│   ├── provider/              # @freeanima/capabilities-provider（或 capabilities-provider-openai）\n"
"│   ├── mcp/                   # @freeanima/capabilities-mcp\n"
"│   ├── acp/                   # @freeanima/capabilities-acp\n"
"│   └── clarify/               # @freeanima/capabilities-clarify\n"
"├── connectors/\n"
"│   ├── eventbus-sqlite/       # @freeanima/connectors-eventbus-sqlite\n"
"│   ├── gateway/               # @freeanima/connectors-gateway\n"
"│   ├── webui/                 # @freeanima/connectors-webui（HTTP server + Vue SPA）\n"
"│   ├── cron/                  # @freeanima/connectors-cron\n"
"│   └── commands/              # @freeanima/connectors-commands\n"
"├── service/                   # @freeanima/service（AnimaService + serve）\n"
"├── cli/                       # @freeanima/cli\n"
"└── tests/                     # @freeanima/integration-tests\n"
"```\n"

