#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:77
msgid "### Migration Steps"
msgstr "### 迁移步骤"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:81
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Step | Package | Status |\n"
"| ---- | ------- | ------ |\n"
"| 0–11 | See table below | ✅ Complete (2026-06-05) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 步骤 | 包     | 状态                    |\n"
"| ---- | ------ | ----------------------- |\n"
"| 0–11 | 见下表 | ✅ 已完成（2026-06-05） |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:96
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Step | Package | Completion criteria |\n"
"| ---- | ------- | ------------------- |\n"
"| 0 | legacy rename | Full repo imports to legacy; legacy shells later removed |\n"
"| 1 | `kernel/` | hooks / eventbus / schemas / db |\n"
"| 2 | `capabilities/provider/` | LLM Provider implementations |\n"
"| 3 | `engine/` | Main loop + tool loop; engine calls `@freeanima/engine-db` directly |\n"
"| 4 | `life/memory/` | Memory pipeline, skills, retrieval |\n"
"| 5 | `life/self/` | Shell (`@freeanima/life-self`) |\n"
"| 6 | `life/estate/` | Shell (`@freeanima/life-estate`) |\n"
"| 7 | `capabilities/*` | tools / mcp / acp / clarify |\n"
"| 8 | `connectors/*` | gateway / cron / commands / webui |\n"
"| 9 | `service/` | `serve` + `AnimaService` assembles full stack |\n"
"| 10 | `cli/` | `anima` bin → `@freeanima/service` |\n"
"| 11 | Remove legacy | Remove `packages/`, `apps/` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 步骤 | 包                       | 完成标准                                            |\n"
"| ---- | ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 0    | legacy rename            | 全 repo import 切 legacy；后已删 legacy 壳          |\n"
"| 1    | `kernel/`                | hooks / eventbus / schemas / db                     |\n"
"| 2    | `capabilities/provider/` | LLM Provider 实现                                   |\n"
"| 3    | `engine/`                | 主循环+工具循环；engine 直调 `@freeanima/engine-db` |\n"
"| 4    | `life/memory/`           | 记忆管道、skills、检索                              |\n"
"| 5    | `life/self/`             | 空壳（`@freeanima/life-self`）                      |\n"
"| 6    | `life/estate/`           | 空壳（`@freeanima/life-estate`）                    |\n"
"| 7    | `capabilities/*`         | tools / mcp / acp / clarify                         |\n"
"| 8    | `connectors/*`           | gateway / cron / commands / webui                   |\n"
"| 9    | `service/`               | `serve` + `AnimaService` 组装全栈                   |\n"
"| 10   | `cli/`                   | `anima` bin → `@freeanima/service`                  |\n"
"| 11   | 删 legacy                | 移除 `packages/`、`apps/`                           |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:98
msgid ""
"Production entry: `anima service` → [`service/service/src/serve.ts`](../../"
"service/service/src/serve.ts)."
msgstr ""
"生产入口：`anima service` → [`service/service/src/serve.ts`](../../service/"
"service/src/serve.ts)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:100
msgid "### Cross-Cutting Modules"
msgstr "### 横切模块"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:106
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Module | Transition | Final home |\n"
"| ------ | ---------- | ---------- |\n"
"| `@freeanima/engine-db` | **Migrated** to `engine/db`; shared by life/memory and service | Long-term persistence; types in engine-db |\n"
"| EventBus/registry/config implementations | New kernel keeps interfaces only | service |\n"
"| Turbo/CI | Merged into main CI (typecheck / lint / dep-check / test) | |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 模块                          | 过渡期                                               | 最终归属                       |\n"
"| ----------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n"
"| `@freeanima/engine-db`        | **已迁入** `engine/db`；life/memory 与 service 共用  | 长期持久化层；类型在 engine-db |\n"
"| EventBus/registry/config 实现 | 新 kernel 只留接口                                   | service                        |\n"
"| Turbo/CI                      | 已合并入主 CI（typecheck / lint / dep-check / test） |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:108
msgid "### Key Design Decisions (Responding to Open Items)"
msgstr "### 关键设计决策（回应待讨论项）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:115
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| # | Question | Decision |\n"
"| - | -------- | -------- |\n"
"| 1 | Main loop with zero tools at startup | Already satisfied; empty tool list enables pure chat, no special handling |\n"
"| 2 | Skills ownership | **memory** (procedural memory); self handles HOOK injection |\n"
"| 3 | Capability layer registration | Each package exports independently; **service layer unified register entry** |\n"
"| 4 | Migration strategy | **Parallel new packages + legacy rename** (this plan) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| #   | 问题               | 决策                                              |\n"
"| --- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 1   | 零工具启动时主循环 | 已满足，空 tool list 即可纯对话，无需特殊处理     |\n"
"| 2   | Skills 归属        | **memory**（程序性记忆）；self 负责 HOOK 注入     |\n"
"| 3   | 能力层注册方式     | 各包独立 export，**service 层统一 register 入口** |\n"
"| 4   | 迁移策略           | **并行新包 + legacy rename**（本文方案）          |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:117
msgid "### Required New-Stack Improvements"
msgstr "### 新栈必做改进"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:121
msgid ""
"**TurnLifecycle unified** — ✅ `turn-lifecycle.ts` (non-streaming + "
"streaming)"
msgstr "**TurnLifecycle 统一** — ✅ `turn-lifecycle.ts`（非流式 + 流式）"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:121
msgid ""
"**engine calls db directly** — ✅ `engine-conversation` → `@freeanima/engine-"
