msgstr ""
"**engine 直调 db** — ✅ `engine-conversation` → `@freeanima/engine-db`（不做 "
"SessionStore 注入）"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:121
msgid ""
"**AnimaService split** — ✅ `anima-service` + status/sessions/memory/"
