msgstr ""
"**AnimaService 拆分** — ✅ `anima-service` + status/sessions/memory/"
"messaging 模块"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:123
msgid "### Layer Boundary dep-check"
msgstr "### 层边界 dep-check"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:125
msgid ""
"Script: [`scripts/check-layer-deps.ts`](../../scripts/check-layer-deps.ts), "
"`bun run dep-check` (in `bun run check`)."
msgstr ""
"脚本：[`scripts/check-layer-deps.ts`](../../scripts/check-layer-deps.ts)，"
"`bun run dep-check`（已挂入 `bun run check`）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:134
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer | Allowed `@freeanima/*` | Forbidden |\n"
"| ----- | ---------------------- | --------- |\n"
"| `kernel/**` | `kernel-*` | Other workspace packages |\n"
"| `engine/**` | `kernel-*`, `engine-*`, `service-config`, `service-logging`, `capabilities-provider-*` | `connectors-*`, `service` (runtime) |\n"
"| `life/**` | `kernel-*`, `life-*`, `engine-tool`, `connectors-sqlite`, `service-config`, `service-logging` | Other `connectors-*`, `service` |\n"
"| `capabilities/**` | `kernel-*`, `engine-*`, `capabilities-*`, `life-memory`, `service-config`, `service-logging` | `connectors-*`, `service` |\n"
"| `connectors/**` | Lower layers + `service` | — |\n"
"| `service/**` | All | — |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 层                | 允许 `@freeanima/*`                                                                           | 禁止                                 |\n"
"| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `kernel/**`       | `kernel-*`                                                                                    | 其他 workspace 包                    |\n"
"| `engine/**`       | `kernel-*`、`engine-*`、`service-config`、`service-logging`、`capabilities-provider-*`        | `connectors-*`、`service`（runtime） |\n"
"| `life/**`         | `kernel-*`、`life-*`、`engine-tool`、`connectors-sqlite`、`service-config`、`service-logging` | 其他 `connectors-*`、`service`       |\n"
"| `capabilities/**` | `kernel-*`、`engine-*`、`capabilities-*`、`life-memory`、`service-config`、`service-logging`  | `connectors-*`、`service`            |\n"
"| `connectors/**`   | 各下层 + `service`                                                                            | —                                    |\n"
"| `service/**`      | 全部                                                                                          | —                                    |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/issue-1-migration-plan.md:136
